With this file, it works, Xen boots :

```
[global]
default=xen

[xen]
options=loglvl=all com1=115200,8n1 console=com1,vga
kernel=vmlinuz root=/dev/md2 ro rootdelay=10 noquiet nosplash 
earlyprintk=xen
ramdisk=initrd.img
```

